# Kabiru AI Tutor — Frontend production environment variables
#
# Vite bakes these into the build at BUILD TIME (not runtime), so this must
# be set in your hosting platform's "Environment Variables" for the BUILD
# step (Render Static Site, Vercel, Netlify, etc.) — not just for running
# the app afterward.
#
# Copy this file's contents into your platform's dashboard, replacing the
# URL with your actual deployed backend URL (no trailing slash).

VITE_API_URL=https://kabiru-ai-tutor-backend.onrender.com
